triggers: pull requests to main and pushes to main. on PR  run the checks, on push to main run everything and deploy.

jobs: secret scan,  tests and dependency .0 scan. then build the docker image , then scan the image, push it, deploy to staging, then deploy to prod.

steps for test job: checkout the code, setup python, pip install requirments, run pytest.

artifact: the docker image, tagged with the commit sha.

environments: dev/ci, staging, prod. prod needs approval it.

fail fast: secret scan  should run first, so if something is wrong we stop early.
hotfix
